			"widgets_values":[
				"A smooth and realistic hair growth transformation video using the provided first frame and last frame images. The same Brazilian blonde woman remains perfectly centered, looking directly at the camera in the same bathroom. Her identity, facial features, skin tone, head position, body posture, clothing, necklace, camera angle, lighting and background remain completely unchanged throughout the video.\n\nAt the beginning, her hair is visibly sparse and thin, with a wide center part and clear scalp visibility on the top of the head. Over the course of 5 seconds, her hair gradually becomes thicker, fuller and denser in a natural and continuous way. The visible scalp area slowly reduces, the center part becomes narrower, and new hair naturally fills in the thinning areas from the roots outward.\n\nHair density increases progressively and evenly, strand by strand, until the hair looks fuller, healthier, softer and more abundant, matching the final frame. The hair color must remain exactly the same blonde tone with darker roots. The hairstyle, hair length and hair direction remain consistent, only the density and fullness change.\n\nSubtle natural hair movement only, stable camera, realistic skin texture, realistic hair strands, smooth continuous transition, photorealistic beauty video, high detail, natural bathroom lighting, seamless transformation, 5-second duration."
			],
